WEBVTT

00:01.260 --> 00:02.670
Gulls!

00:02.670 --> 00:04.800
I've never seen real ones before!

00:04.800 --> 00:06.910
Do they have gulls in Yoana, too?

00:06.910 --> 00:10.670
Yup, although probably not as big as these.

00:14.750 --> 00:16.790
Are you okay, Lante?

00:16.820 --> 00:19.240
<b>LIMP</b>

00:17.210 --> 00:19.240
Do I <i>look</i> okay?

00:19.480 --> 00:21.090
I've had it.

00:21.090 --> 00:24.460
Can't your holy beast do something about this?

00:24.770 --> 00:27.860
Bennu says his power is regeneration,

00:27.860 --> 00:31.840
so he can cure injuries, but not queasiness.

00:31.840 --> 00:32.870
Seriously?

00:32.870 --> 00:35.130
And right now, he's in the same boat.

00:35.130 --> 00:37.140
<b>Sick</b>

00:35.130 --> 00:37.140
<b>(from drinking
too much)</b>

00:37.420 --> 00:39.370
Sailing doesn't bother you, Sari?

00:39.370 --> 00:42.720
Nope. Seeing all these new 
things is so much fun.

00:43.080 --> 00:44.770
And this time...

00:44.770 --> 00:45.950
Sariphi.

00:48.440 --> 00:50.380
You were about to fall overboard.

00:50.990 --> 00:52.920
<i>His Majesty is with me.</i>

02:23.990 --> 02:29.000
Invasion and the Wolf Without a Kingdom

02:29.780 --> 02:34.330
By the way, I noticed 
Mr. Chancellor stayed home again.

02:34.330 --> 02:36.420
I left him to oversee matters in my absence.

02:36.850 --> 02:40.660
The past few days have 
brought troubling reports.

02:42.930 --> 02:44.560
<i>Is this true?</i>

02:44.930 --> 02:49.870
Yes, sire. Major anti-monarchist 
groups throughout the realm

02:49.870 --> 02:53.770
seem to have ceased or 
curtailed their activities.

02:53.770 --> 02:55.890
Is this not good news?

02:55.890 --> 03:00.140
It shows that His Majesty has made 
his might felt far and wide.

03:00.570 --> 03:02.730
Is there some cause for disquiet?

03:02.730 --> 03:04.230
No. Except...

03:04.710 --> 03:10.010
Largely independent organizations have gone 
silent together, as though in concert.

03:10.840 --> 03:14.690
<i>That is what troubles me.</i>

03:14.690 --> 03:15.890
Sire?

03:16.730 --> 03:19.880
No, this need be no concern of yours.

03:20.410 --> 03:23.980
And although we are going to inspect 
the new kingdom of Bolstobas,

03:23.980 --> 03:27.850
you have no particular duties there, either.

03:28.230 --> 03:30.040
Rest easy.

03:30.040 --> 03:30.970
But...

03:31.710 --> 03:34.610
What should I do when 
I don't <i>have</i> to do anything?

03:35.120 --> 03:39.010
I want to know how I can get 
closer to being a great queen.

03:39.450 --> 03:43.380
If only I were at least 
breathtakingly beautiful...

03:43.940 --> 03:45.790
But I'm nowhere near that, either.

03:46.130 --> 03:52.050
Sariphi, you need only follow your 
heart and do what you feel is right.

03:52.570 --> 03:56.580
That will always give hope 
to someone, somewhere,

03:56.580 --> 03:58.960
just as it did to me.

04:00.430 --> 04:04.170
I know of no woman to surpass your beauty.

04:04.810 --> 04:07.760
Your pure-white hair, which naught can sully.

04:07.760 --> 04:09.890
Your clear, delicate skin.

04:09.890 --> 04:12.780
And your blue eyes, 
which see through deception.

04:14.200 --> 04:21.530
In my eyes, every part of you is 
as breathtaking as the heavens.

04:26.280 --> 04:30.090
Well? A speech like that ought 
to give you some confidence.

04:30.090 --> 04:31.000
Huh?

04:31.420 --> 04:34.960
<i>Oh, I get it. He wanted to cheer me up.</i>

04:35.860 --> 04:40.070
Thank you, sire! But you overdid 
it with the compliments.

04:42.430 --> 04:45.100
My Lord Chancellor! Urgent tidings!

04:47.540 --> 04:48.830
Is this definite?

04:48.830 --> 04:52.460
A messenger from the western 
land of Wald just delivered it.

04:53.750 --> 04:55.870
Is... Is something the matter, sir?

04:55.870 --> 04:59.750
Inform His Majesty at once. 
Dispatch a messenger beast!

04:59.750 --> 05:00.420
Yes, sir!

05:04.740 --> 05:05.680
Begging your pardon.

05:06.110 --> 05:09.280
Your Majesty, Chancellor Anubis 
sends this message from the palace.

05:15.050 --> 05:17.130
We're going back to Ozmargo right now?!

05:17.440 --> 05:19.750
I've had urgent news from the palace.

05:19.750 --> 05:22.610
I can't speak further on the subject, 
but we will return at once.

05:22.610 --> 05:24.190
W-Wait a minute.

05:25.080 --> 05:29.720
Isn't this visit to Bolstobas an 
important duty for you, sire?

05:29.720 --> 05:31.680
Yes, but—

05:32.000 --> 05:36.560
Then this is exactly when 
I should be filling in for you!

05:36.560 --> 05:37.740
No.

05:37.740 --> 05:40.260
Don't worry. Just like in Maasya, I'll—

05:40.260 --> 05:41.100
No!

05:45.170 --> 05:45.940
Sire.

05:45.940 --> 05:52.420
You just told me to follow my heart 
and do what I feel is right, remember?

05:53.320 --> 05:55.280
I don't know what's gone wrong,

05:55.940 --> 06:01.300
but I can tell it's serious, and I want 
to help you now more than ever.

06:02.160 --> 06:05.290
So please, let me do this.

06:12.270 --> 06:16.180
Very well. But do nothing 
to endanger yourself.

06:16.180 --> 06:17.790
R-Right!

06:17.790 --> 06:19.930
And give me your left hand.

06:29.500 --> 06:30.630
What's this?

06:33.110 --> 06:35.080
A charm of sorts.

06:35.520 --> 06:40.280
To dispel my... trifling misgivings.

06:40.850 --> 06:42.060
<i>Sire...</i>

06:44.130 --> 06:45.740
The rest is in your hands.

06:45.740 --> 06:46.250
Yes, sire.

06:46.760 --> 06:49.390
Lanteveldt, I leave Sariphi in your care.

06:49.940 --> 06:50.970
'Kay.

06:51.880 --> 06:52.730
Yes, sire!

06:57.910 --> 07:02.110
<i>What could it be? 
His Majesty seems so anxious.</i>

07:03.620 --> 07:04.700
<i>I don't know why,</i>

07:05.840 --> 07:07.360
<i>but I have a bad feeling.</i>

07:08.530 --> 07:11.070
<b>Loake Sea</b>

07:10.280 --> 07:11.080
Halt!

07:11.550 --> 07:13.790
Your ship lacks permission to sail!

07:13.790 --> 07:15.420
Stop at once!

07:16.040 --> 07:18.090
<i>Persistent nuisances.</i>

07:18.090 --> 07:20.910
<i>And right when I'm rushing 
back to the castle.</i>

07:21.150 --> 07:24.880
<i>It's been at least ten days since I left it.</i>

07:24.880 --> 07:25.870
Halt!

07:26.210 --> 07:29.580
<i>He's bound to be growing impatient by now.</i>

07:30.450 --> 07:32.780
<i>That man never could wait.</i>

07:33.640 --> 07:35.350
Wh-What's that?

07:42.690 --> 07:43.980
I see I was too late.

07:44.720 --> 07:46.440
That's right, you were.

07:46.790 --> 07:53.900
You kept me waiting so long that 
I got bored and went out for a flight.

07:56.090 --> 08:00.170
You just sank an Istanese naval patrol.

08:00.170 --> 08:02.450
The palace will soon hear of that.

08:02.780 --> 08:06.660
Didn't you plan to remain 
hidden a while longer?

08:07.040 --> 08:09.020
I changed my mind.

08:09.020 --> 08:14.140
And since I'm already out here, 
why not go storm the royal palace now?

08:14.370 --> 08:18.360
The time is not yet ripe. We can strike 
once we solidify support from—

08:18.360 --> 08:20.200
I'm sick of waiting!

08:20.740 --> 08:26.080
How I long to sink my teeth 
into that man's throat at last.

08:34.980 --> 08:37.570
Like a sign from heaven.

08:40.510 --> 08:41.450
What?!

08:41.450 --> 08:43.030
It came from the bow!

08:43.910 --> 08:45.280
What's this?

08:45.520 --> 08:48.960
I thought this was an Ozmargan royal vessel.

08:48.960 --> 08:51.260
Why are there only peons on board?

08:51.560 --> 08:53.870
What are you?! Pirates?!

08:54.300 --> 08:57.970
Don't mistake me for some lowly ruffian.

08:58.470 --> 09:01.300
I am Fenrir, the King of Wolves,

09:01.930 --> 09:05.300
and the new ruler of beastkind.

09:06.090 --> 09:08.400
<i>A new king?!</i>

09:08.980 --> 09:11.250
B-Balderdash!

09:11.480 --> 09:18.460
Hardly. My minions are invading several 
Ozmargan territories as we speak.

09:18.460 --> 09:24.090
I'll one day strike down that man, 
the king of Ozmargo.

09:24.090 --> 09:27.440
Then all beasts will be under <i>my</i> rule.

09:27.440 --> 09:28.370
Huh?!

09:28.370 --> 09:29.510
Shh!

09:29.870 --> 09:32.050
<i>Invading Ozmargo?!</i>

09:32.050 --> 09:35.220
<i>Is that why His Majesty was called 
back to the palace so suddenly?!</i>

09:36.030 --> 09:38.820
I can't let such disrespect for 
His Majesty go unpunished!

09:38.820 --> 09:39.700
Seize him!

09:39.700 --> 09:40.540
Yes, sir!

09:40.540 --> 09:41.560
Nir.

09:45.880 --> 09:48.680
Wh-What was that?! Where did 
those swords come from?!

09:49.710 --> 09:50.890
Now,

09:50.890 --> 09:56.610
tell me, who is the highest-ranking 
individual on this ship?

09:56.610 --> 09:59.580
Wh-Why do you ask?

09:59.580 --> 10:03.390
I'll have them come with me.

10:03.390 --> 10:06.040
And when I take the throne,

10:06.040 --> 10:09.650
I'll sacrifice them as proof of my kingship.

10:11.250 --> 10:14.210
Answer honestly, or you all die.

10:16.070 --> 10:19.920
No one wants to speak up? What a shame.

10:21.330 --> 10:24.890
Then let the executions begin.

10:28.340 --> 10:29.730
Please, no more!

10:33.500 --> 10:34.650
What?

10:38.160 --> 10:39.470
A human?

10:40.880 --> 10:44.750
Now Kotan, an eastern 
province, is under attack?!

10:44.750 --> 10:49.950
Th-This is clearly an invasion! 
We must act swiftly!

10:49.950 --> 10:52.910
But how, when we don't even 
know who our enemy is?

10:52.910 --> 10:57.850
Quiet. I will send my Royal Guard 
to Kotan, along with Horus's men.

10:57.850 --> 11:00.760
My personal troops will 
fight on the front lines

11:00.760 --> 11:05.190
and show these foolish rebels 
the might of Ozmargo.

11:05.190 --> 11:06.480
Please wait, sire.

11:07.710 --> 11:12.400
If this is an invasion, then this palace 
is our enemy's ultimate goal.

11:12.910 --> 11:18.400
Would it not be wiser to keep your main 
force here and fortify the capital?

11:19.740 --> 11:23.410
<i>I</i> am here. Is that not sufficient?

11:25.070 --> 11:30.320
These simultaneous attacks on Wald 
in the west and Kotan in the east

11:30.320 --> 11:33.760
are most likely a ploy to divide 
our kingdom's forces.

11:35.220 --> 11:42.300
I suggest we put the capital first 
and send a cavalry company to Kotan.

11:42.950 --> 11:44.600
Will that be enough?

11:44.600 --> 11:46.230
Certainly.

11:46.230 --> 11:48.600
I will take command

11:49.020 --> 11:51.240
and go to Kotan myself.

11:51.240 --> 11:53.130
C-Can it be?

11:53.130 --> 11:56.240
Anubis, leaving the palace?!

12:00.320 --> 12:01.830
And you are?

12:01.830 --> 12:05.000
Sariphi, the acting queen of Ozmargo.

12:05.000 --> 12:09.030
And right now, I'm the 
highest-ranking person on this ship.

12:12.560 --> 12:14.150
You, the queen?!

12:14.150 --> 12:15.750
Now, that's a good one!

12:16.350 --> 12:17.540
It's the truth.

12:18.950 --> 12:22.250
Why else would a human be on this ship?

12:22.550 --> 12:25.420
You say you want to be king,

12:25.420 --> 12:29.430
but you didn't even know the king of Ozmargo 
took a human for his acting queen?

12:29.430 --> 12:30.740
Sari!

12:31.110 --> 12:33.310
So if you must take someone, take me.

12:34.100 --> 12:36.680
And leave everyone else on this ship alone.

12:38.990 --> 12:45.540
What you say, if it is the truth, 
doesn't make you any more valuable.

12:45.540 --> 12:49.400
It just shows how worthless 
Ozmargo's queen is.

12:50.130 --> 12:52.380
That's how I see it.

12:53.380 --> 12:55.620
<i>My worth...</i>

12:57.210 --> 13:01.680
<i>As a human, I don't count without 
His Majesty at my side.</i>

13:02.110 --> 13:04.270
<i>I'm acting queen in name only.</i>

13:04.980 --> 13:09.130
<i>But if something gives me value anyway...</i>

13:10.590 --> 13:11.870
If I have value,

13:12.620 --> 13:17.940
then it's because he loves 
me and no one else.

13:20.680 --> 13:23.270
Now, take me away.

13:23.620 --> 13:29.110
If you ignore me and hurt the others, 
you'll only feel ashamed later,

13:30.000 --> 13:32.350
when people ask how someone 
who called himself king

13:32.350 --> 13:36.510
could be taken in by appearances 
and fail to see what I'm really worth.

13:37.170 --> 13:40.350
<i>What a stupid bluff.</i>

13:40.790 --> 13:46.410
<i>Could this human really have </i>his<i> love?</i>

13:47.440 --> 13:52.620
<i>The love of the man who took 
everything from me that day?</i>

13:53.690 --> 13:57.600
Fenrir, this human is probably 
telling the truth.

13:58.130 --> 14:00.570
She had guards protecting her in Maasya.

14:03.840 --> 14:07.120
All right. You'll be my sacrifice.

14:07.850 --> 14:09.420
S-Sari!

14:09.420 --> 14:10.520
Let's go, Nir.

14:10.520 --> 14:12.190
Sari!

14:12.190 --> 14:13.990
<i>I'm sorry, sire.</i>

14:14.790 --> 14:18.140
<i>Forgive me for using your feelings like this.</i>

14:19.020 --> 14:22.670
<i>But it's the only way I can protect everyone.</i>

14:23.530 --> 14:26.220
<i>So... I can't go back to—</i>

14:26.220 --> 14:27.120
Not so fast.

14:28.560 --> 14:31.670
Don't think you'll get away with 
this just 'cause I'm seasick.

14:32.150 --> 14:36.180
Hands off. She's the one I serve.

14:36.460 --> 14:38.060
Who are you?

14:38.650 --> 14:43.650
Lanteveldt the Hyenian, 
captain of the Queen's Guard of Ozmargo.

14:44.240 --> 14:46.850
So when someone hurts the queen,

14:46.850 --> 14:48.060
I get rid of them!

14:49.070 --> 14:49.980
Lante, behind you!

14:51.510 --> 14:54.480
<i>He dodged that? He has good reflexes.</i>

14:54.480 --> 14:55.210
<i>However...</i>

14:56.540 --> 14:57.920
<i>The swords changed direction?</i>

14:57.920 --> 15:00.630
<i>He's controlling them with magic!</i>

15:01.070 --> 15:01.800
Lante!

15:08.060 --> 15:09.130
Such weakness.

15:09.690 --> 15:12.330
A guardian must not suffer defeat.

15:12.330 --> 15:16.300
It means death for his master, 
as well as himself.

15:16.630 --> 15:21.990
You lack resolve, boy. Stay out of our way.

15:24.540 --> 15:25.620
Wait!

15:27.650 --> 15:33.270
I already agreed to go with you, 
but only if you don't hurt the others.

15:33.740 --> 15:35.530
That was our deal.

15:36.140 --> 15:40.480
Spare him, Nir. A promise is a promise.

15:40.910 --> 15:45.010
A king must stand by his words.

15:45.610 --> 15:47.440
You're in luck.

15:48.930 --> 15:52.590
Wait. You're just gonna leave?

15:53.360 --> 15:56.100
I'm the captain of your guard.

15:56.580 --> 15:59.870
I'll do my job,

16:00.290 --> 16:01.800
even if it kills me!

16:04.550 --> 16:05.680
Lante.

16:06.730 --> 16:09.730
As acting queen consort, 
I hereby command you.

16:10.220 --> 16:13.650
Return to the palace, and obey the king.

16:15.830 --> 16:19.630
Bennu, would you patch up 
Lante and the others for me?

16:21.000 --> 16:22.580
S-Sari...

16:22.980 --> 16:27.040
Clops, I want you to tell His 
Majesty something for me.

16:37.650 --> 16:39.280
What the hell?

16:39.790 --> 16:40.960
Damn it.

16:41.480 --> 16:44.710
Damn it all!

16:46.060 --> 16:48.810
We will reach Kotan by dawn.

16:48.810 --> 16:50.640
Prepare to sally forth at once.

16:50.900 --> 16:51.910
Yes, sir!

16:51.910 --> 16:53.480
M-My Lord Chancellor!

16:53.970 --> 16:55.020
Yes?

16:55.020 --> 16:55.850
Terrible news!

16:56.270 --> 16:58.800
The people are mobbing the palace gates!

16:59.720 --> 17:05.530
Your Majesty! Is it true that 
someone is invading our land?!

17:05.530 --> 17:10.330
What should we do?! 
Is it safe here in the capital?!

17:11.470 --> 17:13.790
So word has already spread.

17:14.290 --> 17:15.880
Restore order immediately!

17:15.880 --> 17:17.010
Chancellor Anubis!

17:17.360 --> 17:19.140
Oh, what is it now?!

17:19.140 --> 17:19.550
Milord,

17:19.910 --> 17:24.240
an urgent messenger beast 
from a ship bound for Bolstobas

17:24.240 --> 17:27.920
has returned with a servant 
of the acting queen consort.

17:28.690 --> 17:30.700
Wh-What?!

17:30.700 --> 17:32.660
Repeat your report!

17:32.660 --> 17:37.980
O-Our ship was attacked by someone 
who called himself Fenrir, King of Wolves.

17:37.980 --> 17:44.080
And Sari—the acting queen consort—
let him take her to protect us!

17:45.170 --> 17:48.420
All while Captain Lanteveldt was with her?

17:48.420 --> 17:50.580
What a debacle.

17:51.180 --> 17:54.560
<i>Fenrir... I know that name from somewhere.</i>

17:55.340 --> 17:59.260
And this man truly claimed 
to be invading our kingdom?

17:59.260 --> 18:03.140
Y-Yes. And he said that when 
he became the new king,

18:03.140 --> 18:05.950
he would sacrifice Sari!

18:08.530 --> 18:10.430
Where does Your Majesty propose to go?

18:10.810 --> 18:14.400
Stop asking pointless questions 
and stand aside.

18:14.650 --> 18:21.020
I will not. This is not like when the 
human brat abducted Lady Sariphi.

18:21.530 --> 18:28.220
If you leave the palace now, 
the damage could be irreparable.

18:28.550 --> 18:31.810
You expect me to sit here, then?

18:31.810 --> 18:34.940
To do nothing when my queen has been taken?

18:34.940 --> 18:36.670
Naturally, a search party will—

18:36.670 --> 18:39.250
There's no time for that!

18:39.920 --> 18:43.420
If this Fenrir is the same man I remember,

18:44.140 --> 18:47.540
then his grudge against me must run deep.

18:47.540 --> 18:50.480
Who knows what he'll do to Sariphi?

18:50.880 --> 18:53.050
Stand aside, Anubis!

18:53.050 --> 18:55.730
Stand aside, or even you will feel my wrath!

18:56.850 --> 19:00.690
Very well, sire. If you insist,

19:01.740 --> 19:04.080
then kill me and depart.

19:07.450 --> 19:12.030
This realm must never be exposed 
to the threat of usurpation.

19:12.470 --> 19:15.690
And I will never consent 
to serve another king.

19:15.690 --> 19:20.980
I would much rather die at Your 
Majesty's hands here and now.

19:28.520 --> 19:32.960
Organize a search party at once. 
I shall communicate with Bolstobas.

19:32.960 --> 19:34.030
Y-Yes, milord!

19:34.690 --> 19:38.480
<i>What am I doing?</i>

19:39.470 --> 19:46.150
<i>I made Sariphi my queen, thinking that 
my royal authority could protect her.</i>

19:46.840 --> 19:48.500
<i>But what is the reality?</i>

19:48.970 --> 19:54.530
<i>I cannot rush to her side </i>because<i> I am king.</i>

19:55.420 --> 20:00.360
<i>What is authority, then? What is kingship?</i>

20:02.080 --> 20:08.890
B-Begging Your Majesty's pardon... 
S-Sari gave me a message.

20:10.150 --> 20:14.150
She said, "Don't come to rescue me."

20:17.900 --> 20:20.890
<i>Sariphi... I see.</i>

20:20.890 --> 20:21.980
<i>So you...</i>

20:23.840 --> 20:25.940
What the hell is going on?!

20:25.940 --> 20:27.860
Please, sire, speak to us!

20:28.310 --> 20:29.820
Oh, look!

20:30.440 --> 20:32.210
His Majesty is here!

20:32.210 --> 20:33.830
Your Majesty!

20:35.650 --> 20:41.250
Some do indeed scheme to invade my realm!

20:41.250 --> 20:43.050
That is a fact!

20:43.870 --> 20:45.880
But it is no cause for alarm!

20:46.310 --> 20:51.720
No one can conquer Ozmargo and its people!

20:52.140 --> 20:53.180
Not while...

20:53.890 --> 20:55.240
<i>I</i> am here!

20:56.320 --> 21:03.000
Whoever should threaten this realm, 
I will not fail to strike down!

21:03.700 --> 21:05.270
Y-Your Majesty...

21:05.270 --> 21:06.730
Your Majesty!

21:06.730 --> 21:09.230
Long live the king!

21:09.230 --> 21:11.280
Long may he reign!

21:11.660 --> 21:17.260
<i>Sariphi, as queen, 
you acted to protect us all.</i>

21:17.960 --> 21:23.310
<i>And you told me to defend those to which 
I've sworn, as well. To be their king.</i>

21:24.310 --> 21:29.280
<i>So, as king, I shall defend my people.</i>

21:30.540 --> 21:34.920
<i>I expect him to come for my 
head himself in the end.</i>

21:35.880 --> 21:41.150
<i>I </i>will<i> track him down 
before he storms my palace.</i>

21:41.730 --> 21:43.530
<i>And then,</i>

21:44.100 --> 21:45.790
<i>I will fight.</i>

21:46.250 --> 21:50.580
<i>To defend my realm. To win you back.</i>

21:51.520 --> 21:53.560
<i>Even if it costs me my life!</i>

