23:28.620 --> 23:31.480
But will you be all right 
on the front lines?

23:31.480 --> 23:34.800
Don't underestimate me. 
Focus on guarding His Majesty.

23:35.280 --> 23:39.610
This is the greatest threat 
in the history of Ozmargo.

